{"ID":"20240205153809-7t59anx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153809-7t59anx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153809-7t59anx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103808-pmqolxj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613132133-qow26e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702123409-f5yg5d6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"318郁李仁","type":"doc","updated":"20240827100750"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240826162626-7p5gg6t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240826162626-7p5gg6t","updated":"20240827100750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"错录"}]},{"ID":"20240826162801-v61v656","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240826162801-v61v656","updated":"20240826163612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李 8-20240826162801-hutv6op.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 692px;","style":"width: 682px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李 9-20240826162835-2wihtff.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 682px;\" parent-style=\"width: 692px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826162920-k2zzg1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240826162920-k2zzg1h","updated":"20240826163611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 387px;","style":"width: 377px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李 10-20240826162920-i4cyz4v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 377px;\" parent-style=\"width: 387px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 682px;","style":"width: 672px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李 11-20240826162955-r37qgzr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 672px;\" parent-style=\"width: 682px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826163651-t54k1xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240826163651-t54k1xv","updated":"20240826163651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李 12-20240826163651-j9oboiy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826162640-4y8lho7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240826162640-4y8lho7","updated":"20240826162637"}},{"ID":"20240826162640-y46ld1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240826162640-y46ld1b","updated":"20240826162637"}},{"ID":"20240826162626-ph504fy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20240826162626-ph504fy","updated":"20240827100750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郁李仁"}]},{"ID":"20240206103808-pmqolxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103808-pmqolxj","updated":"20240826162634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产东北地区以及河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t郁李：核果近球形，深红色，直径约1cm；核表面光滑。\n欧李：核果成熟后近球形，红色或紫红色，直径1.51.8cm；核表面除背部两侧外无棱纹。长柄扁桃：种子卵形，长610mm，直径5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7mm。表面黄白色浅棕色，一端尖，另端钝圆。尖端一侧有线形种脐，圆端中央有深色合点，自合点处向上具多条纵向维管束脉纹。种皮薄，子叶乳白色，富油性。味微苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦、甘，平。\n【功效】\t润燥滑肠，下气，利水。用于津枯肠燥、食积气滞、腹胀便秘、水肿、脚气、小便不利。\n【炙品】\t炒郁李仁：取净郁李仁置锅中，用文火加热，炒至深黄色并有香气逸出时，取出放凉。炒郁李仁常用于利小便，消水肿。\n郁李仁霜：取郁李仁净肉，研成粗粉，用吸油纸包好，置榨床内榨去油，每隔1天换纸1次，换纸时须将郁李仁研成粉后，再压榨，如此反复压榨几次，至油几净，手捏松散成粉，取出研细。郁李仁霜滑肠作用极弱，可用于行气散结，活血破瘀。\n朱砂拌郁李仁：取净郁李仁，喷少许清水使外表稍湿，撤入朱砂粉簸动至均匀为度，取出风干。每郁李仁1kg，用朱砂18g。朱砂拌郁李仁多用于焦虑失眠。\n蜜郁李仁：取净郁李仁，按一般蜜炙法进行操作。每郁李仁100kg，用蜜12kg。蜜郁李仁润肠作用增强，常用于肠燥便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103811-td92ns4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103811-td92ns4","updated":"20240826162634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103811-h0bfhkn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160809-ok31w7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160809-ok31w7u","updated":"20240826162634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"郁李仁"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/郁李仁-20240205160809-yguljay.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"2024082